# Bug / defect management

- Product bugs = `Bug` model + `/api/bugs*` + UI `/bugs` (sidebar) — not GitHub Issues.
- Soft-delete via `deleted_at`; restore / purge only from recycle view.
- Link optionally to `interface_id`, `test_case_id`, `auto_test_result_id`, `monitor_id`, `monitor_run_id`.
- Third-party trackers: store `external_url` only (no silent dual-write / sync plugins unless explicitly built).
- OperationLog stays in existing enum (`test`) for bug CRUD.
- Monitor failing runs may deep-link to `/bugs?project_id&monitor_id&monitor_run_id&title&description`.
